<title>BELGIUM: SOCCER-ANDERLECHT V INTERNAZIONALE TEAMS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ANDERLECHT V INTERNAZIONALE TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for Tuesday's UEFA Cup quarter-final first-leg match between Anderlecht of Belgium and Italy's Internazionale of Milan:</p>
<p>Anderlecht - 1-Geert De Vlieger; 24-Marc Emmers, 18-Suad Katana, 12-Olivier Doll, 14-Samuel Johnson, 4-Celestine Babayaro, 11-Danny Boffin, 5-Johan Walem, 10-Par Zetterberg, 13-Bruno Versavel, 8-Yaw Preko</p>
<p>Internazionale - 1-Gianluca Pagliuca; 2-Giuseppe Bergomi, 20-Jocelyn Angloma, 7-Salvatore Fresi, 18-Nicola Berti, 4-Javier Zanetti, 19-Massimo Paganin, 8-Paul Ince, 21-Ciriaco Sforza, 9-Ivan Zamorano, 6-Youri Djorkaeff</p>
</text>
